{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aKS7cQboiT1795341150.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>印尼一間糖果工廠發生火災，警方在現場搬出24個屍袋，估計有多人喪生，4人受傷，約30人失蹤。</p><p></p><p>搜救人員在燒毀廠房內搜索。事發在周六晚，涉事工廠位於萬丹省，主要生產本地品牌的牛奶糖與零食等產品。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.FIRE-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RmVQxNl2WM1795341159.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方指，每具尋獲的遺體可能包含數人的遺體殘骸。當局指由於火勢猛烈，難以通過目視辨認身份，當前正採集失蹤工人的DNA樣本，幫助確認遇難者身份。工廠負責人稱，當日約有300人上班，早前搜救部門宣布15人獲救。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.FIRE-1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tEX79Fostk1795341170.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.762727+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:05:51.676410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:17.994087+00:00","content_hash":"a2eb73d0eb9559928d332264e2769b38ac253a80046d3f8668974017538113d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.762727+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}